      {
        "id": "def-nuisance-tangent-orthogonal-complement",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "Orthogonal complement of a nuisance tangent space",
        "statement": "Within L²₀(P), the nuisance orthogonal complement consists of all mean-zero square-integrable h with P(hg)=0 for every nuisance tangent score g; it is a closed linear subspace.",
